  "Description": {
    "Cost": 7975869,
    "UIName": "Mastodon",
    "Id": "chassisdef_mastodon_MAS-C",
    "Name": "Mastodon",
    "Details": "After Clan Hell's Horses forces' invaded the Rasalhague Dominion during Operation Noyan in 3147, the Mastodon was designed and signified a large change from their previous reliance on a mix of Executioner variants as the mainstay of their army. The Mastodon's performance after its introduction makes it inevitable that it will be at the forefront of many campaigns to come. The heavily reinforced structure resists both weapons fire and the standard wear and tear that accompanies most campaigns. The C configuration tends to overheat easily due to its four ER Medium Lasers, three Plasma Cannons and ER PPC. The 'Mech also sports a Gauss Rifle for longer range engagements.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_mastadon"
  },
