  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "A very recent design from Jötunn BattleWorx, they bring together a lot of the recently learned clan technologies to create a powerful OmniMech. Thanks to its durability Mastodon MechWarriors often exaggerate signs of damage, prompting foes to overcommit in attempts to down them. Coordination with quicker units usually results in an enveloped and defeated opponent—and a still-functioning Mastodon.",
